==== textPath ====
There exist no renderer and no browser (at least neither Chrome nor Firefox) that fully suppport <code>textPath</code>: e.g:
#librsvg does not support it at all(!)
#resvg not in combination with <code>textLength</code>
#Inkscape supports negative offsets wrong
#batik chrashes sometimes, here it is difficult to find out what's wrong
